  "sentence": {
    "text": "I've been leading meditation retreats and teaching these practices for the last 25 years, both around the world and most especially in southwest France in the retreat center I founded here called Moulin de Chave, which is where I live. I've written a book which is also called Awake Where You Are, and that goes into these practices in a lot of depth and detail. And I also run a year-long training in mindfulness teaching with another Waking Up contributor, Mark Coleman, and have an online platform for live and interactive meditation teachings and practices called Sangha Live. Anyway, you can find all that stuff and other links to my various teaching activities, both online and in person, at my website martinalewood.com.",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 49.1
  },
